nd said, \"O Ṣāliḥ, bring us what you promise us, if you should be of the messengers.\"","j":8,"h":16,"s":7,"a":77,"sd":null},{"k":"7:78","t":"So the earthquake seized them, and they became within their home [corpses] fallen prone.","j":8,"h":16,"s":7,"a":78,"sd":null},{"k":"7:79","t":"And he [i.e., Ṣāliḥ] turned away from them and said, \"O my people, I had certainly conveyed to you the message of my Lord and advised you, but you do not like advisors.\"","j":8,"h":16,"s":7,"a":79,"sd":null},{"k":"7:80","t":"And [We had sent] Lot when he said to his people, \"Do you commit such immorality as no one has preceded you with from among the worlds [i.e., peoples]?","j":8,"h":16,"s":7,"a":80,"sd":null},{"k":"7:81","t":"Indeed, you approach men with desire, instead of women. Rather, you are a transgressing people.\"","j":8,"h":16,"s":7,"a":81,"sd":null}],"juz":8,"hizb":16,"surahs":[7],"sajdah":false}